  "body": "### Name and Version\n\nversion: B11400, 0bb496d\n\n### Operating systems\n\nLinux\n\n### GGML backends\n\nSYCL\n\n### Hardware\n\nVM CPU (32 Ryzen 9 5950X)\n2x Intel B70\n\n### Models\n\nunsloth/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-GGUF:UD-IQ3_XXS\n\n### Problem description & steps to reproduce\n\nI'm getting a performance regression from this PR and every subsequent commit.\n\nSettings (llama-server via llama-swap):\n\n`\nllama-server --port ${PORT} -dev SYCL0,SYCL1 -fa on -fit off -ts 1,1 -kvu -sm layer -ctxcp 3 -b 1024 -ub 2048  -hf unsloth/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-GGUF:UD-IQ3_XXS  -ctk q8_0 -ctv q8_0 -ngl 999 -lzm on -ot per_layer_token_embd.weight=CPU -lm mmap -c 196608 -np 1 --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --top-k 20 --presence-penalty 0.0 --min-p 0.00 --jinja --reasoning on --reasoning-effort xhigh --reasoning-preserve\n`\n\ntest prompt: I gave it a small text file and asked it to summarize it.\n\nPR #29612 (one previous to this): pp: ~420t/s tg: ~32t/s\nPR #29622 (this one): pp: ~365t/s tg: ~24t/s\n\nI've observed the same performance regression up to the current PR as of writing (PR #29971).\n\n### First Bad Commit\n\n0bb496d\n\n### Relevant log output\n\n<details>\n<summary>Logs</summary>\n<!-- Copy-pasted short logs go into the \"console\" area here -->\n\n```console\n\n```\n</details>\n\n<!-- Long logs that you upload as files go here, outside the \"console\" area -->\nsee above",
